{"title":"Meetily Pro 0.1.6 Release Notes | Meetily","blocks":{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"section","id":"page-intro","children":[{"type":"h1","text":"Meetily Pro 0.1.6"},{"type":"p","text":"November 20, 2025"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"a","text":"Skip to main content","href":"#main"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h2","text":"Release Highlights"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"November 20, 2025"}]}]},{"type":"p","text":"Windows stability and onboarding improvements"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Fixed Windows PowerShell popup"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Smoother onboarding experience"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Pro activation reliability"}]}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"summary","text":"Table of Contents"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h2","text":"What's New in Pro 0.1.6","id":"whats-new-in-pro-016"},{"type":"p","text":"This release focuses on improving the Windows experience and making onboarding smoother for new Pro users. We've addressed several issues that were affecting the initial setup process and fixed an annoying visual glitch on Windows."},{"type":"h3","text":"Windows Improvements","id":"windows-improvements"},{"type":"p","text":"We've eliminated the PowerShell popup window that would briefly flash on screen during certain operations. This provides a cleaner, more polished experience for Windows users without any distracting command prompt windows appearing unexpectedly."},{"type":"h3","text":"Smoother Onboarding","id":"smoother-onboarding"},{"type":"p","text":"The onboarding experience has been refined with several targeted fixes:"},{"type":"ul","children":[{"type":"li","text":"Smarter database handling: The app now detects if you already have an existing database in your app data directory and skips the import step, preventing conflicts and speeding up the setup process for returning users."},{"type":"li","text":"Streamlined system tray: During onboarding, the system tray menu is now limited to essential actions (open main window and quit) to prevent confusion and keep you focused on completing the setup."}]},{"type":"h3","text":"Pro Activation Reliability","id":"pro-activation-reliability"},{"type":"p","text":"We've resolved an issue where Pro feature activation could fail during the onboarding process. License validation now works correctly, ensuring your Pro features are properly enabled from the start."},{"type":"h2","text":"Download","id":"download"},{"type":"ul","children":[{"type":"li","text":"macOS (Apple Silicon): Download .dmg\n(opens in new tab)"},{"type":"li","text":"Windows: Download .exe\n(opens in new tab)"}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}]},{"type":"h3","text":"Ready to try Meetily?"},{"type":"p","text":"Join 599,000+ users who use Meetily for private meeting transcription. No bots, privacy first. Community Edition free."},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"No meeting bots"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"100% local transcription"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Free & open source"}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"a","text":"Download Free","href":"/downloads"},{"type":"button","text":"Try Pro Free"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Star on GitHub (31K+) · Open source & self-hostable"}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h3","text":"Download Meetily"},{"type":"p","text":"Get Meetily for Mac or Windows."},{"type":"a","text":"Download","href":"/downloads"}]}]}]}]}]}]},"links":[{"text":"Skip to main content","href":"#main"},{"